              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ninkwehanangiriza omu maisho ga Ruhanga na Kristo, oricwera abahuriire n'abafiire orubanja, kandi ahabw'okugaruka kwe n'obukama bwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.20.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 20:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.20.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ogume obuurire ekigambo kya Ruhanga, ogambe n'obweziriki omu bunaku oburagiirwe n'butaragiirwe, ohane, oteise, oyehanangirize n'okugumisiriza kandi n'okwegyesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tim 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba ebiro biryaija, obu abantu baryanga kuhurira enyegyesa y'amazima; kwonka ahabw'okugira amatu agarikubarya baryayekanyisiza abeegyesa abarikwegyesa nk'okwetenga kwabo oku kuri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " beigare amatu ngu batahurira amazima, bahabe, bakuratire ebiteekyerezo by'ebigunjano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka iwe, oyerinde omuri byona, ogumisiririze obusaasi, okore omurimo gw'omubuurizi w'engiri, ohikize kimwe okuheereza kwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
